{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_206_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_206","textTraditional":"一、二十有六年。春王正月，葬宋元公。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_206_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_206","textTraditional":"二、三月，公至自齊，居于運。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_206_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_206","textTraditional":"三、夏，公圍成。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_206_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_206","textTraditional":"四、秋，公會齊侯、莒子、邾婁子，〈木巳〉伯盟于剸陵。公至自會，居于運。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_206_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_206","textTraditional":"五、九月庚申，楚子居卒。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_206_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_206","textTraditional":"六、冬十月，天王入于成周。尹氏、召伯、毛伯以王子朝奔楚。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_206_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_206","textTraditional":"成周者何？東周也。其言入何？不嫌也。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}